{"surah":107,"ayahs":["أَرَءَيْتَ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِى يُكَذِّبُ بِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">دِّي</span>نِ","فَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">ذَٰ</span>لِكَ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِى يَدُعُّ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْيَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">تِي</span>مَ","وَلَا يَحُضُّ عَلَىٰ طَعَامِ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمِسْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">كِي</span>نِ","فَوَيْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">لٌ لِّ</span>لْمُصَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">لِّي</span>نَ","ٱلَّذِينَ هُمْ عَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">ن صَ</span>لَاتِهِمْ سَا<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">هُو</span>نَ","ٱلَّذِينَ هُمْ يُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">رَآ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">ءُو</span>نَ","وَيَمْنَعُونَ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمَا<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">عُو</span>نَ"]}